name: sim.subtractObjectFromPointCloud
description: Removes an object from a point cloud, as a subtraction
luaSynopsis: int totalPointCnt = sim.subtractObjectFromPointCloud(int pcHandle, int objectHandle, int options, float tolerance)
pythonSynopsis: int totalPointCnt = sim.subtractObjectFromPointCloud(int pcHandle, int objectHandle, int options, float tolerance)
inputs:
1. pcHandle: handle of the point cloud
2. objectHandle: handle of the object to subtract. Only potentially measurable objects are supported
3. options: reserved. Set to 0
4. tolerance: distance used as a tolerance value
outputs:
1. totalPointCnt: total number of points in the point cloud
